WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.949 --> 00:00:05.550
Click the AI button to open the Agents panel.

2
00:00:05.944 --> 00:00:12.956
On the Connect tab, one click adds Krypt Studio to Claude Code, Cursor or VS Code. It's free on the Krypt side.

3
00:00:13.370 --> 00:00:16.807
The built-in chat needs your own Anthropic API key.

4
00:00:17.222 --> 00:00:23.909
Then just ask for a beat. Your agent builds it while you watch: drums, bass and chords in the Channel Rack,

5
00:00:24.301 --> 00:00:28.573
then the arrangement and a master chain, and it reviews its own render.

6
00:00:33.662 --> 00:00:39.003
Not your thing? Open History and revert everything the AI did, in one click.
